1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Seventh Episode
The Battle of Vengeance

15
00:02:04,101 --> 00:02:06,535
- It's the dove!
- It has the letter from Prince Franz

16
00:02:06,581 --> 00:02:08,458
that you've been waiting for so long!

17
00:02:08,701 --> 00:02:11,010
You did a good job,
little dove.

18
00:02:11,061 --> 00:02:13,017
It does a good job every day.

19
00:02:13,381 --> 00:02:16,817
You and Franz love each other so much
that you exchange letters every day.

20
00:02:17,061 --> 00:02:18,653
Tink!

21
00:02:20,221 --> 00:02:22,018
I've noticed that you love each other.

22
00:02:22,061 --> 00:02:23,653
Stop it!

23
00:02:24,101 --> 00:02:26,774
"My dear Sapphire,
I can't wait to see you!

24
00:02:26,821 --> 00:02:29,540
To me you are the moon,
the sun and the stars!"

25
00:02:36,581 --> 00:02:38,412
Have a good trip, little dove!

26
00:02:57,021 --> 00:03:00,013
Here he comes up! I recognize
Prince Franz's footsteps.

27
00:03:00,061 --> 00:03:02,700
Every time he is to receive a
letter from his Princess...

28
00:03:02,741 --> 00:03:06,620
...he is so impatient!
- Haven't you received a reply?

29
00:03:06,821 --> 00:03:09,654
You must wait, Prince,
but it will arrive soon.

30
00:03:09,741 --> 00:03:12,619
How about playing a little
while we wait?

31
00:03:12,661 --> 00:03:14,379
Agreed.

32
00:03:15,021 --> 00:03:17,012
Then I'll start!

33
00:03:19,781 --> 00:03:21,612
1, 2, 3, 4 and 5!

34
00:03:22,421 --> 00:03:24,252
I'll do 6!

35
00:03:27,741 --> 00:03:30,938
Ah, yes, you won!
But if I were ten years younger...

36
00:03:31,141 --> 00:03:34,736
Forget about your age,
please! You aren't old at all.

37
00:03:36,021 --> 00:03:39,331
You're back, little one! The
Prince was waiting for you!

38
00:03:44,821 --> 00:03:47,460
Why don't you read
that letter, Prince?

39
00:03:47,501 --> 00:03:50,493
It's so important to me that I
don't feel like opening it right away.

40
00:03:53,661 --> 00:03:57,017
He is totally captivated
by the Princess's charm.

41
00:03:59,781 --> 00:04:02,136
There is a message from
the Northern fortress.

42
00:04:02,261 --> 00:04:04,092
Prince Franz!

43
00:04:04,581 --> 00:04:06,492
Prince Franz!

44
00:04:07,781 --> 00:04:10,090
- What is it?
- Read!

45
00:04:10,261 --> 00:04:12,331
What? A fleet is threatening us?!

46
00:04:24,741 --> 00:04:26,299
Prince!

47
00:04:27,461 --> 00:04:29,577
They have no identifying marks.

48
00:04:30,981 --> 00:04:34,132
Look, they're raising a flag!
But it's the flag of Union X!

49
00:04:34,901 --> 00:04:36,493
Watch out!

50
00:04:37,741 --> 00:04:40,016
To Prince Franz
of the kingdom of Goldland.

51
00:04:40,061 --> 00:04:42,017
Our fleet
and our army,

52
00:04:42,061 --> 00:04:44,450
strong with a million soldiers,
are advancing South.

53
00:04:45,301 --> 00:04:48,452
We have defeated all those who
opposed our advance.

54
00:04:48,501 --> 00:04:51,493
Abandon all useless resistance
and surrender to us.

55
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:54,738
If you do not answer us tonight,
before the moon sets,

56
00:04:54,781 --> 00:04:57,500
we will attack you and destroy you.
You have been warned".

57
00:04:57,701 --> 00:04:59,817
Union X, damn it!

58
00:05:13,021 --> 00:05:16,809
Apparently, there will be
once again another war.

59
00:05:17,021 --> 00:05:20,297
This time it threatens to be
a very hard war.

60
00:05:20,341 --> 00:05:24,016
I thought I would no longer have to use
the armor, but I was wrong.

61
00:05:24,261 --> 00:05:28,334
Why does Union X want to attack
peaceful Goldland again?

62
00:05:33,461 --> 00:05:35,691
That is the flag
of the kingdom of Charcoalland.

63
00:05:35,741 --> 00:05:37,618
What could they want from us?

64
00:05:37,661 --> 00:05:41,210
What are you saying? The Sovereign of Charcoalland
is offering us reinforcements?!

65
00:05:41,261 --> 00:05:45,618
Yes, Sire! We will not leave in danger
a country bordering us.

66
00:05:45,661 --> 00:05:47,811
We will fight with 50,000 men.

67
00:05:47,861 --> 00:05:49,897
- 50,000 men?!
- Yes.

68
00:05:49,941 --> 00:05:52,011
Now they are massed at the border.

69
00:05:52,061 --> 00:05:55,576
If you allow it, they will be deployed
to defend the river banks.

70
00:05:56,541 --> 00:05:59,009
Coming to our aid
is a kind act.

71
00:05:59,061 --> 00:06:02,940
Make sure the Ambassadors
rest peacefully tonight.

72
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:18,574
Squadron, halt! We will stop here!

73
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:26,735
Soldiers,
I ask for your attention!

74
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:29,454
Soon the moon will set
behind the mountains,

75
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:33,494
then the Union X army
will advance from that bay from the North.

76
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,891
But the King of Charcoalland
has committed himself...

77
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:38,171
..to check the East side
of our borders.

78
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:40,610
We must defend
our fortress.

79
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:43,334
We must defend it from all
the enemies that will attack it!

80
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,417
Yes!

81
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:03,491
Archers, fire!

82
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:09,094
Hurrah! Hooray!

83
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:18,216
We must reach Goldland
Castle as soon as possible!

84
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,092
At a gallop!

85
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:24,735
Good, the battle has begun!

86
00:07:24,780 --> 00:07:27,249
Now get to work and be
careful not to be noticed.

87
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:29,019
Yes, sir!

88
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:56,216
Squadron, charge!

89
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:04,140
The enemy is entering the
castle from the East side!

90
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:07,173
Impossible, it is guarded
by Charcoalland's army!

91
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:10,258
At the eastern border, there is no one!
Charcoalland's army...

92
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,940
...has moved against us!
- It's a trap!

93
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:17,012
And I fell for it!

94
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:23,899
Little doves,
it's dangerous to stay here!

95
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:27,653
Fly away!
Go away to Silverland!

96
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:30,855
What a traitor that Ambassador is!

97
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:33,017
Anyway, I can't waste time!

98
00:08:47,221 --> 00:08:49,018
What is it?

99
00:08:54,341 --> 00:08:56,332
Poor pigeons..!

100
00:08:57,421 --> 00:08:59,491
What happened to you?

101
00:08:59,541 --> 00:09:02,738
Good heavens! Could something have happened
in the kingdom of Goldland?!

102
00:09:27,221 --> 00:09:29,530
Soldier,
do you know where Prince Franz is?

103
00:09:29,581 --> 00:09:31,731
He is in the Northern fortress,
knight.

104
00:09:31,781 --> 00:09:33,260
Thank you.

105
00:09:38,021 --> 00:09:41,650
- Charcoalland's flag!
- Halt! What do you want? Who are you?

106
00:09:41,901 --> 00:09:44,415
- Stay right where you are!
- Help me, Opal!

107
00:09:46,941 --> 00:09:49,091
Run! Chase that wretch!

108
00:09:49,461 --> 00:09:51,656
Don't let him get away! Get him!

109
00:09:52,381 --> 00:09:54,292
Stop!

110
00:10:00,021 --> 00:10:02,455
- But what was that?
- It felt like a gust of wind!

111
00:10:13,901 --> 00:10:18,019
But these are Goldland soldiers!
Let's see if they are still alive!

112
00:10:20,221 --> 00:10:22,689
Thank goodness,
this one has regained consciousness!

113
00:10:23,101 --> 00:10:25,899
- Take this!
- No! What are you doing? Wait!

114
00:10:33,901 --> 00:10:36,017
I thought that no one
could resist me,

115
00:10:36,061 --> 00:10:38,017
except for Prince Franz.

116
00:10:38,061 --> 00:10:40,859
As a soldier of the kingdom of
Charcoalland, you are quite good!

117
00:10:41,621 --> 00:10:44,499
I find a worthy rival in you.
What is your name?

118
00:10:44,541 --> 00:10:47,851
The people of Silverland call me
"the mysterious knight."

119
00:10:47,901 --> 00:10:50,176
The people of Silverland?!
But then you...

120
00:10:50,221 --> 00:10:53,770
Exactly, I am on your side!
I came here to help you!

121
00:10:53,821 --> 00:10:56,130
Forgive me, I am terribly sorry.

122
00:10:56,181 --> 00:10:58,331
I believed that you were an enemy.

123
00:10:58,381 --> 00:11:00,770
I am glad that you
realized the mistake.

124
00:11:00,821 --> 00:11:03,335
Now we must try to
bring our help to Goldland.

125
00:11:03,381 --> 00:11:06,851
I apologize to you once
again, mysterious knight.

126
00:11:08,381 --> 00:11:11,578
I was going to the Northern
fortress, but I was attacked...

127
00:11:11,621 --> 00:11:14,579
...and overwhelmed by a mob of
enemies and I lost consciousness.

128
00:11:14,621 --> 00:11:17,579
I am ashamed of myself,
but now I am ready to fight.

129
00:11:17,621 --> 00:11:20,374
However, I am very
worried about Prince Franz.

130
00:11:20,421 --> 00:11:23,015
What do you say? Are you
also looking for Prince Franz?

131
00:11:23,061 --> 00:11:25,894
I have the task of receiving
and delivering to my Prince...

132
00:11:25,941 --> 00:11:29,013
...the letters that Princess Sapphire
sends him from your kingdom.

133
00:11:29,061 --> 00:11:31,211
So you were taking care
of the pigeons?

134
00:11:31,261 --> 00:11:34,856
Of course, it was me!
Those little creatures were wonderful!

135
00:11:45,421 --> 00:11:48,140
Prince Franz!
Now the kingdom of Goldland...

136
00:11:48,181 --> 00:11:50,490
...is in the hands of Union X
and in mine!

137
00:11:50,541 --> 00:11:52,816
- Why do you still not surrender?
- You wretch!

138
00:11:52,861 --> 00:11:56,456
King of Charcoalland, here is my
answer to your treachery!

139
00:12:04,021 --> 00:12:07,331
Storm the castle!
Wipe out those dogs!

140
00:12:16,941 --> 00:12:19,171
Good heavens, perhaps it's too late.

141
00:13:06,021 --> 00:13:08,296
Franz! Prince Franz! Where are you?

142
00:13:14,381 --> 00:13:16,417
Franz, where are you? Franz!

143
00:13:20,501 --> 00:13:22,856
I recognize this!
It's his hat!

144
00:13:58,661 --> 00:14:02,654
- Do you know where Prince Franz is?
- No, I don't know.

145
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:07,650
Do you happen to have any news
of Prince Franz?

146
00:14:07,701 --> 00:14:09,737
No, no news.

147
00:14:32,141 --> 00:14:34,097
Sapphire, where could you be?

148
00:14:36,301 --> 00:14:38,690
Come inside, Prince.
The evening dampness...

149
00:14:38,741 --> 00:14:40,493
...is not good for your wound.

150
00:14:40,541 --> 00:14:44,170
I know, but I would like to leave here.
Unfortunately, I cannot walk.

151
00:14:45,501 --> 00:14:47,810
Now I don't even have
a horse anymore.

152
00:14:47,861 --> 00:14:51,217
As if that weren't enough,
Goldland Castle is on fire.

153
00:14:51,621 --> 00:14:53,612
I know how you feel.

154
00:14:58,701 --> 00:15:01,295
But now, let me tend to your wound.

155
00:15:12,741 --> 00:15:15,653
Please, moon, let Franz be alive.

156
00:15:27,261 --> 00:15:30,651
Prince, write a letter
to Princess Sapphire.

157
00:15:30,741 --> 00:15:32,572
What? And how do I send it to her?

158
00:15:32,621 --> 00:15:35,579
I will take it to her, instead of a dove.

159
00:15:35,621 --> 00:15:37,612
- But how?
- Trust me!

160
00:15:37,661 --> 00:15:40,733
Perhaps she is worried about
you! Take off your cloak, please.

161
00:15:40,781 --> 00:15:43,011
- My cloak?!
- Yes, your cloak!

162
00:15:43,061 --> 00:15:45,575
Write on it with this piece of charcoal.

163
00:15:45,621 --> 00:15:48,897
- It's the only way to write.
- It's a good idea.

164
00:15:51,261 --> 00:15:55,539
Some of your soldiers might
have found refuge in Silverland.

165
00:15:55,941 --> 00:15:58,216
We must inform them
that you are still alive.

166
00:15:58,261 --> 00:16:00,616
I'll take care of it.
I'll be back tomorrow.

167
00:16:06,181 --> 00:16:09,014
Look! Isn't that
the Prince of Goldland?

168
00:16:09,061 --> 00:16:11,734
Yes, it's him. There is a big bounty
on his head.

169
00:16:11,981 --> 00:16:14,495
- Let's take that bounty ourselves!
- Of course,

170
00:16:14,541 --> 00:16:16,771
but we must think about
the other one first.

171
00:16:16,821 --> 00:16:20,450
Let's move! Let's follow him and try
to surprise him from behind,

172
00:16:20,501 --> 00:16:22,617
so it will be easier
to get rid of him.

173
00:16:37,221 --> 00:16:40,213
Where the hell could he have gone?
I don't see him anymore.

174
00:16:43,261 --> 00:16:45,252
Dammit!

175
00:16:45,301 --> 00:16:47,496
He's so big! Help!

176
00:16:48,741 --> 00:16:51,892
I'm sorry for you,
but I can't let you escape!

177
00:16:53,461 --> 00:16:55,258
What the hell is happening?

178
00:16:56,421 --> 00:16:59,697
- Stop him!
- Don't let him escape!

179
00:16:59,741 --> 00:17:01,254
Get him!

180
00:17:04,621 --> 00:17:06,498
Come on!

181
00:17:14,021 --> 00:17:16,615
Stop him!
Hit him with arrows!

182
00:17:16,661 --> 00:17:18,413
Kill him!

183
00:17:24,621 --> 00:17:27,499
- I'll help you!
- Mysterious knight, save yourself!

184
00:17:27,541 --> 00:17:30,419
- The mysterious knight?!
- I will take you with me to Silverland,

185
00:17:30,461 --> 00:17:32,531
If you can keep up the gallop!
Follow me!

186
00:17:44,341 --> 00:17:46,901
Curse it, they've entered
the kingdom of Silverland!

187
00:17:46,941 --> 00:17:48,772
Damn them!

188
00:17:48,821 --> 00:17:51,574
Take heart, we're almost
there! Hang in there!

189
00:17:51,661 --> 00:17:54,095
Quickly, open the door!
It's Sapphire!

190
00:17:54,741 --> 00:17:56,220
There is a wounded man!

191
00:17:57,021 --> 00:17:59,455
You know, Prince Franz is alive.

192
00:17:59,501 --> 00:18:01,492
- What?!
- Yes, he is hidden now.

193
00:18:01,541 --> 00:18:04,214
..
..

194
00:18:04,261 --> 00:18:06,536
.

195
00:18:06,581 --> 00:18:08,219
in the Shinewood cave, and he is wounded. Then
let's go down there right away to get him. Hurry up!

196
00:18:08,261 --> 00:18:12,777
Mysterious knight, please
give this to Princess Sapphire.

197
00:18:13,221 --> 00:18:16,418
But... isn't this
Prince Franz's cloak?

198
00:18:16,941 --> 00:18:20,013
Actually, it contains a message
intended for the Princess.

199
00:18:20,061 --> 00:18:22,894
Hey, you shouldn't read a letter
addressed to someone else.

200
00:18:23,341 --> 00:18:26,413
- That's true, sorry!
- Anyway, I am grateful to you

201
00:18:26,461 --> 00:18:30,295
...for taking care of me.
My only regret...

202
00:18:30,341 --> 00:18:33,492
- What do you regret?
- You know, mysterious knight,

203
00:18:33,541 --> 00:18:37,011
I really wanted to deliver
the letter to the Princess myself.

204
00:18:37,621 --> 00:18:39,816
It's my only regret!

205
00:18:48,541 --> 00:18:51,135
How I wish I could meet her
before I die!

206
00:18:52,261 --> 00:18:54,934
Old Dodd!
Good old Dodd!

207
00:18:55,061 --> 00:18:58,133
- And who are you?
- I am Sapphire.

208
00:18:58,181 --> 00:19:00,900
I thank you for all the letters
you sent me...

209
00:19:00,941 --> 00:19:02,818
...via your dear doves!

210
00:19:04,901 --> 00:19:07,813
Princess,
you are so beautiful and kind!

211
00:19:08,021 --> 00:19:11,138
Just as I thought!
I am happy to have met you!

212
00:19:12,021 --> 00:19:15,297
Now I have done my duty.
One last request, Princess:

213
00:19:15,341 --> 00:19:17,571
I entrust Prince Franz to you.

214
00:19:17,861 --> 00:19:20,898
Please, form an alliance
between your kingdom and Goldland!

215
00:19:20,941 --> 00:19:23,171
Together you can defeat
the enemy.

216
00:19:23,741 --> 00:19:26,380
Yes, old Dodd, I will

217
00:19:26,541 --> 00:19:29,738
I am happy about it. I have nothing more
to worry about now.

218
00:19:29,781 --> 00:19:32,011
I can finally die in peace.

219
00:19:33,261 --> 00:19:37,300
Old Dodd!
Old Dodd, no!

220
00:19:43,181 --> 00:19:45,297
My brave men, attack!

221
00:19:51,021 --> 00:19:55,299
Dear Sapphire, Goldland is now
occupied by enemy troops.

222
00:19:55,661 --> 00:19:58,095
I am wounded in the leg
and I cannot walk.

223
00:19:58,461 --> 00:20:01,931
I will not be able to see you again, but I am
so happy to have met you.

224
00:20:02,901 --> 00:20:05,017
I am ready
to fight strenuously.

225
00:20:05,061 --> 00:20:07,495
I am always
the Prince of Goldland.

226
00:20:08,021 --> 00:20:10,535
If my body remains
lifeless on the field,

227
00:20:10,581 --> 00:20:12,890
my heart will be with you
forever.

228
00:20:13,301 --> 00:20:16,338
I wish you to be happy
from the depths of my soul.

229
00:20:17,021 --> 00:20:19,899
Prince Franz
to Princess Sapphire.

230
00:20:39,461 --> 00:20:41,179
Forward!

231
00:20:50,301 --> 00:20:52,019
Franz, hold on!

232
00:20:55,301 --> 00:20:58,099
- Who is there?
- Hello, Prince Franz! How is it going?

233
00:21:01,141 --> 00:21:03,735
- Now that I see you, it’s going better!
- Go, Franz!

234
00:21:04,741 --> 00:21:06,811
Go, mysterious knight!

235
00:21:06,901 --> 00:21:09,051
The enemy is annihilated!

236
00:21:11,901 --> 00:21:14,620
It looks like
another group of enemies is coming!

237
00:21:15,341 --> 00:21:17,616
Let's make a strategic retreat!

238
00:21:17,701 --> 00:21:20,340
Of course! We will beat them!

239
00:21:28,341 --> 00:21:31,014
Princess Sapphire is waiting for you
at that farm.

240
00:21:31,061 --> 00:21:33,859
I'll go and inform her first.
This is yours, isn't it?

241
00:21:35,381 --> 00:21:37,690
But how could he have gotten my hat?

242
00:21:56,541 --> 00:22:00,216
Old Dodd, we will reconquer Goldland for you as well.

243
00:22:06,781 --> 00:22:11,059
Old Dodd, I too will act according to your last wish.

244
00:22:12,341 --> 00:22:15,413
Sapphire, what were
his last words?

245
00:22:17,461 --> 00:22:21,090
"Goldland and Silverland should
ally and destroy the enemy."

246
00:22:26,101 --> 00:22:28,774
I entrust Prince Franz to you.

247
00:22:28,821 --> 00:22:32,018
I wish both of you
eternal happiness.

248
00:22:32,061 --> 00:22:34,370
I will watch over you, dear friends.

249
00:22:37,141 --> 00:22:39,416
Franz, he also said
that he wished...

250
00:22:39,461 --> 00:22:42,021
...that you would recover
and be happy in your kingdom,

251
00:22:42,061 --> 00:22:44,131
finally without any more enemies.

252
00:22:44,621 --> 00:22:48,694
Thank you, Sapphire! I will try
to take care of myself as he wanted...

253
00:22:49,021 --> 00:22:51,819
...and I will bring his body
to the castle of Goldland.

254
00:22:53,421 --> 00:22:57,255
I will stifle the outbreaks of war
and bring peace back to Goldland.

255
00:22:58,341 --> 00:23:00,571
You will help me, won't you, Sapphire?

256
00:23:02,461 --> 00:23:05,737
We will join forces to defeat our
enemies and we will be so strong...

257
00:23:05,781 --> 00:23:08,249
...that no one will
dare attack us anymore!

258
00:24:15,261 --> 00:24:18,881
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

259
00:24:18,882 --> 00:24:22,242
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

260
00:24:22,243 --> 00:24:26,013
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

261
